      "content": "Got it, so it's about finding that balance between metabolic stress and neural recovery. One thing though—for some reason, my client keeps describing this plateau as if something is \"sabotaging\" their progress or like there's some invisible force working against them. Beyond the science of CNS fatigue and volume, is there any other way to look at why progress just suddenly stops like that?",
